<h1>SelPolygon</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Selects all visible points and whole visible entities that are inside a polygon or a free-form shape.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><i style="font-style:italic;">X</i></b>  X-coordinate of the point from the polygon/shape related to the viewport.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Y</i></b>  Y-coordinate of the point from the polygon/shape related to the viewport.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Action</i></b>  where the point belongs to the polygon/shape. Available options are: <i>Begin</i>  the first one. <i>GoTo</i>  the point is intermediate. <i>End</i>  the point is the last one.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><i style="font-style:italic;">SelType</i></b>  how will the selection behave. Available options are:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><i style="font-style:italic;">Repl</i>  the new selection will replace any other selections.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><i style="font-style:italic;">Incl</i>  the new selection will be added to the current selection.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><i style="font-style:italic;">Excl</i>  the new selection will be subtracted from the current selection within its range.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>UI Commands</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><i style="font-style:italic;">Select &gt; Region &gt; Polygon</i> from the main menu. <i>Polygonal selection</i> button on the toolbar <img src="../images/Image20.gif" width="24px" height="24px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">. <i>Select &gt; Region &gt; Freehand</i> from the main menu. <i>Freehand selection</i> button on the toolbar <img src="../images/Image21.gif" width="24px" height="24px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">.</p>
<p class="Note" id="P1"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: Holding Ctrl key while drawing the selection will set Incl for SelType parameter. Holding Alt key while drawing the selection will set Excl for SelType parameter.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Examples:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">SelPolygon( X=-48.478344, Y=-30.083342, Action="Begin", SelType="Repl" )<br>
SelPolygon( X=-27.574612, Y=-35.599606, Action="GoTo", SelType="Repl" )<br>
SelPolygon( X=-50.510651, Y=-37.922241, Action="End", SelType="Repl" )</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">SelPolygon( X=-42.962082, Y=-33.276966, Action="Begin", SelType="Incl" )<br>
SelPolygon( X=-29.606918, Y=-29.793013, Action="GoTo", SelType="Incl" )<br>
SelPolygon( X=-47.897686, Y=-37.051254, Action="End", SelType="Incl" )</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">SelPolygon( X=-45.284718, Y=-36.180264, Action="Begin", SelType="Excl" )<br>
SelPolygon( X=-23.219666, Y=-32.115650, Action="GoTo", SelType="Excl" )<br>
SelPolygon( X=-38.897465, Y=-43.148174, Action="End", SelType="Excl" )</p>
